        "subject": "The brush truck's loaded open body seen from above its rear corner, the panelled tailgate in the bottom quarter, barked limbs with pale ringed ends heaped above it, two pods with cyan-coated lenses at the front corners, the blue boom crossing the upper right under the dek.",
